{"sections":[{"slug":"游走","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"游走"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">游走</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">观念</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"游走"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"观念"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">游走</span></strong> (walking) <span lang=\"zh\">的结构是某种范畴上的结构中最</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">自由</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>, “<span lang=\"zh\">万有</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的一个</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathcal S$ <span lang=\"zh\">是某种范畴的范畴</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">如</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的范畴</span>), $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\mathcal S$ <span lang=\"zh\">的对象上的某种结构</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">如</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"), <span lang=\"zh\">那么</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">游走的</span> $X$” <span lang=\"zh\">是一个对象</span> $x\\in \\mathcal C$ ($\\mathcal C\\in\\mathcal S$), <span lang=\"zh\">使得有自然等价</span>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal S}(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\simeq \\{\\mathcal D\\text{ 中的 }X\\}.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">游走结构也可理解为</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">余</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/分类空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">分类空间</span>"}},{"Plain":"”.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">游走的箭头</span> $\\{0\\to 1\\}$ <span lang=\"zh\">即为两个对象</span> $0,1$ <span lang=\"zh\">与一个态射</span> $0\\to 1$ <span lang=\"zh\">生成的范畴</span>.</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"/游走的伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">游走的伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":"</li>\n<li>$\\mathbf{B}\\mathbb N$, “<span lang=\"zh\">游走的自同态</span>”</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}}]}